{"unit":1,"items":30,"pass":21,"title":"Unit Test · Unit 1","html":"\n  <section class=\"stage on\" data-stage=\"Unit Test\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Unit 1 &middot; Unit Test</div>\n      <h2>Daily life</h2>\n      <p data-t=\"gx249\">Thirty questions on Unit 1 only. Answer them all, then press Check. You need <b>21 out of 30</b> to pass &mdash; and you can take this test as many times as you like.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"review-u1\">\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-t=\"u1r101\">Part 1 &middot; Grammar &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 1&ndash;14</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u1r102\">Choose the correct form.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">&hellip; your sister live in Almaty?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Does</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Do</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">did</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">Where &hellip; last weekend?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">did you go</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">you went</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">neither of these</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">How long &hellip; you known him?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">have</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">do</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">are</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">What &hellip; your brother do?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">does</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">is</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">neither of these</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u1r103\">Complete the question with one word.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\">Who <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"do\" data-why=\"Present Simple question with <i>you</i>: <b>do</b> you live with?\"> you live with?</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\">What time <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"does\" data-why=\"Third person singular: <b>does</b> she get up?\"> she get up?</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">7</span><span class=\"body\">When <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"did\" data-why=\"<i>last</i> points to finished past time: <b>did</b> you last have fun?\"> you last have fun?</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u1r104\">Choose the sentence with the correct word order.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">8</span><span class=\"body\">\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">He always is busy.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">He is always busy.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">neither of these</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">9</span><span class=\"body\">\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">I go often to the gym.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">I often go to the gym.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">neither of these</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">10</span><span class=\"body\">\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">We hardly ever stay in at the weekend.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">We stay hardly ever in at the weekend.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">neither of these</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u1r105\">Each sentence has one wrong word. Click it.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">11</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"errline\" data-err=\"2\" data-why=\"Third person singular: <i>She <b>doesn&rsquo;t</b> like getting up early</i>.\"><span class=\"ew\">She</span> <span class=\"ew\">don&rsquo;t</span> <span class=\"ew\">like</span> <span class=\"ew\">getting</span> <span class=\"ew\">up</span> <span class=\"ew\">early</span></span></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">12</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"errline\" data-err=\"4\" data-why=\"After <b>can&rsquo;t stand</b> the verb takes <i>-ing</i>: <i>can&rsquo;t stand waiting</i>.\"><span class=\"ew\">I</span> <span class=\"ew\">can&rsquo;t</span> <span class=\"ew\">stand</span> <span class=\"ew\">to</span> <span class=\"ew\">wait</span> <span class=\"ew\">in</span> <span class=\"ew\">queues</span></span></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u1r106\">Write the sentence again so that it means the same.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">13</span><span class=\"body\">It is not a problem for me to get up early.<br>I don&rsquo;t mind <input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"getting up early|getting up early.\" data-why=\"<b>Don&rsquo;t mind</b> + <i>-ing</i>: <b>getting up early</b>.\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">14</span><span class=\"body\">You went to the cinema.<br>Where <input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"did you go|did you go?\" data-why=\"Past question: auxiliary + subject + plain verb &mdash; <b>did you go</b>.\"> ?</span></div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-t=\"u1r107\" style=\"margin-top:26px\">Part 2 &middot; Vocabulary &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 15&ndash;24</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u1r108\">Complete each sentence with one word.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">15</span><span class=\"body\">She hardly ever eats a proper <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"meal\" data-why=\"A <b>meal</b> is the food you eat at one time.\"> at work.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">16</span><span class=\"body\">He writes a <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"to-do|to do\" data-why=\"A <b>to-do list</b> is a written list of the things you have to do.\"> list every morning.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">17</span><span class=\"body\">I do the <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"housework\" data-why=\"<b>Housework</b> = cleaning, washing and tidying your home.\"> on Saturday: cleaning, washing, tidying.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">18</span><span class=\"body\">There is a lot of water in the air and it feels heavy. It is very <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"humid\" data-why=\"<b>Humid</b> = with a lot of water in the air.\">.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">19</span><span class=\"body\">The sky is grey all day. It is <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"cloudy\" data-why=\"<b>Cloudy</b> = with a lot of cloud and little sun.\">.</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u1r109\">Choose the correct word.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">20</span><span class=\"body\">It rained for three days and the wind was terrible. The weather was &hellip;\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">pleasant</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">nasty</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">light</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">21</span><span class=\"body\">He goes &hellip; every morning before work.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">running</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">to run</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">run</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">22</span><span class=\"body\">In summer we are always in the garden. We spend most of the day &hellip;\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">indoors</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">outdoors</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">early</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u1r110\">One word in each group does not belong. Click it.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">23</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"errline\" data-err=\"4\" data-why=\"The others are free-time activities. <b>Homework</b> is not one.\"><span class=\"ew\">gym</span> <span class=\"ew\">swimming</span> <span class=\"ew\">karate</span> <span class=\"ew\">homework</span></span></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">24</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"errline\" data-err=\"4\" data-why=\"The others describe weather. A <b>festival</b> is an event.\"><span class=\"ew\">cloudy</span> <span class=\"ew\">damp</span> <span class=\"ew\">humid</span> <span class=\"ew\">festival</span></span></span></div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-t=\"u1r111\" style=\"margin-top:26px\">Part 3 &middot; Function &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 25&ndash;30</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u1r112\">Choose the correct phrase.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">25</span><span class=\"body\">&hellip; do you do?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">What</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">How</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Which</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">26</span><span class=\"body\">&hellip; have you lived here?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">How much</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">How long</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">How often</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">27</span><span class=\"body\">&ldquo;How often are you late for appointments?&rdquo; The natural answer is&hellip;\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">&ldquo;Since 2019.&rdquo;</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">&ldquo;Hardly ever.&rdquo;</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">&ldquo;For two hours.&rdquo;</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u1r113\">Complete with one word.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">28</span><span class=\"body\">I <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"cannot|can&rsquo;t|can't|cant\" data-why=\"<b>Can&rsquo;t stand</b> = hate. It is followed by <i>-ing</i>.\"> stand getting up before six.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">29</span><span class=\"body\">The best time <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"to\" data-why=\"<b>The best time to come</b> &mdash; the recommendation phrase from the model web post.\"> come is May.</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u1r114\">Put the three parts of the recommendation in the usual order.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">30</span><span class=\"body\">\n        <div class=\"order\" data-order=\"r1,r2,r3\">\n          <button class=\"ochip\" data-val=\"r2\"><span class=\"pin\"></span><span class=\"txt\">&mdash; it is warm and dry then.</span></button>\n          <button class=\"ochip\" data-val=\"r3\"><span class=\"pin\"></span><span class=\"txt\">Avoid July, when it is very humid.</span></button>\n          <button class=\"ochip\" data-val=\"r1\"><span class=\"pin\"></span><span class=\"txt\">The best time to visit is April</span></button>\n        </div>\n      </span></div>\n\n      <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"checkReview(this)\" style=\"margin-top:24px\">Check my answers</button>\n      <div class=\"res\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div id=\"reviewResult\" class=\"review-result\"></div>\n  </section>\n"}